{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "9d0bdc7f-839c-80a8-95f2-9169fc55ed98",
  "created_at": "2026-02-09T11:27:01-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Linh Haddad",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sandra Pimentel",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:24:51-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Sandra. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:24:55-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, yes. Um, I need a copy of a, a death certificate. For my uncle. I am... how do you say, I am settling his estate."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:25:04-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, I'm sorry for your loss. Sure, we can help with that. Did he pass away here in Newport?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:25:11-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, in Newport. In January. Is it the same office, or is it the state? Somebody told me the state, then somebody told me the city."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:25:20-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It can be a little confusing. If it happened in Newport, we keep the record here, so you can get a certified copy from us."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:25:28-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So I come to City Hall? Or I send, um, a letter?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:25:33-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You can do either one. Coming in is quickest, you'd usually walk out with it. Mail takes longer."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:25:39-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I come in. What ID do I bring? My passport, or the driver license? I have both, but the passport has my maiden name... no, wait, my old name."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:25:49-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The driver's license is the easiest, a current photo ID. Is the name on it the one you use now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:25:56-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, Haddad. The license is Haddad. So the license is enough? Not the passport also?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:26:02-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just the license should do it. And it helps if you know his full name and the date he passed. Since you're not a spouse or child, they may ask how you're related, so if you have any paper showing you're handling the estate, bring that along too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:26:17-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Paper for the estate. Um, the one from the court? I think I have it at home. I will look. [pause] Sorry, which paper, again? The court one or the one from the bank?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:26:28-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The court one, the one that shows you're the person in charge of the estate. The bank's isn't what we'd need."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:26:35-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, okay. The court. I think I understand. Maybe. I will bring the license and the court paper and his name and the date."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:26:43-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. We're open today until the afternoon, if you're free."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:26:47-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not today. I am going to the hardware store now, for a bag of lightbulbs. Maybe tomorrow I come."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:26:54-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That works. Good luck with the lightbulbs, and take care."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T11:26:58-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Thank you very much. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
